Maintainer: Konkere <amorph@konkere.ru>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt5, libqt5svg5, python3-requests, python3-urllib3, python3-colorama, python3-yaml, python3-packaging, python3-gi, gir1.2-flatpak-1.0, flatpak (>= 1.12), sqlite3
Recommends: libnotify-bin, xdg-utils, libfuse2t64 | libfuse2
Suggests: snapd, sudo, deb-get, shellcheck
Homepage: https://github.com/konkere/dylathleen
Description: Graphical manager for third-party Linux applications
 Dylath-Leen manages Flatpak, Snap, AppImage, marcosnils/bin and deb-get in
 a Qt interface. The last two integrations use separately installed tools.
